<title>USA: CBOE to list Medicis Pharmaceutical options.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Medicis Pharmaceutical options.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Tuesday it would list options on Medicis Pharmaceutical Corp on October 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options would open with strike prices of 45, 50 and 55, with initial expiration months of October, November, January and April.</p>
<p>The options will trade in the EMC Corp trading crowd, it said..</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
